  "comments": "<p>Different Obverse and Reverse dies are known.<br><br><i>Obverse</i><br>Die <strong>1</strong> - E in E.VAZ narrow and far from full stop, the first S in ESCUDOS with short tail.<br>Die <strong>2</strong> - E in E.VAZ wide and close to full stop, the first S in ESCUDOS with short tail.<br>Die <strong>3</strong> - E in E.VAZ wide and close to full stop, the first S in ESCUDOS with long tail.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/616737697bdb4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/616737697bdb4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Die <strong>A</strong> - in the shield in center all 4 escutcheons vertically orientated.<br>Die <strong>B</strong> - in the shield in center side escutcheons orientated to center, details in bold lines.<br>Die <strong>C</strong> - in the shield in center side escutcheons orientated to center, enhanced details with outline.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6167379940be7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6167379940be7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>A</strong>: 1986.<br><strong>1</strong>+<strong>B</strong>: 1987.<br><strong>2</strong>+<strong>C</strong>: 1988-1992.<br><strong>3</strong>+<strong>C</strong>: 1992-2001.<br><br>Correspondence to Weltmünzkatalog / 20. Jahrhundert: 1901-2000<br>Schön#95.1: 1+A.<br>Schön#95.2: 1+B, 2+C, 3+C.</p>",
